 >Frozen starry sky</a></span></p> <hr /> <p><strong>回复：</strong>这竟然是我发布的第一个没被星凌d的界面，不胜荣幸！<span style="color: white">回白字：不，其实我不介意的，觉得文档不符合标准的时候就应该d。当然如果能留下改进意见就更好啦。</span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>是怪物新人！我爱了爱了——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/brucewu0463" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5526785&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609096341" alt="BruceWu0463" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5526785)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/brucewu0463" >BruceWu0463</a></span></p> <hr /> <p><strong>回复：</strong>没有没有，我写得像屎（。）前辈什么时候开个二阶段稿楼啊！</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>与之相比我就是一条真正的咸鱼。——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/carter-lu" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6331978&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609096341" alt="carter lu" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6331978)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/carter-lu" >carter lu</a></span></p> <hr /> <p><strong>回复：</strong>前辈不要说笑了，上过精品的作者怎么能叫咸鱼（。</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&gt;&#32;这是用来复制的留言格式。——[[*user&#32;你的ID]]</span></p> </blockquote> <hr /></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="display:none"> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">脚注</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-488415-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. 俗称金枪鱼。</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-488415-2"><a href="javascript:;" >2</a>. 图片来源见此：<a href="https://pixabay.com/zh/photos/tuna-fish-bigeye-tuna-69317/">https://pixabay.com/zh/photos/tuna-fish-bigeye-tuna-69317/</a> 。使用pixabay授权协议。</div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/keyest" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7027379&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=